{"format":1,"key":"zone:hillsbrad","path":"/lore/zone/hillsbrad","name":"Hillsbrad Foothills","kind":"zone","label":"Zone","zone":{"key":"hillsbrad","name":"Hillsbrad Foothills","path":"/lore/zone/hillsbrad"},"levels":"Levels 20-30","description":"Hillsbrad Foothills remains green while war tears through the last pastoral reaches of Lordaeron. Southshore's humans and the Forsaken at Tarren Mill…","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"zone:hillsbrad","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["Hillsbrad Foothills remains green while war tears through the last pastoral reaches of Lordaeron. Southshore's humans and the Forsaken at Tarren Mill clash across the fields, making the region a violent crossroads for Alliance and Horde armies.","Hillsbrad remains green while blight consumes much of northern Lordaeron. Rolling pastures, pine groves, and working farms still recall the kingdom before the Third War. Armed patrols, rogue mercenaries, and scavenger beasts cross its fields and roads. Lordaeron's breadbasket has become one of its most contested borderlands.","Southshore stands on the southern coast, held by human refugees and soldiers loyal to the Alliance. North of it, Tarren Mill was once a quiet human farming hamlet, until the Scourge destroyed it and the Forsaken fortified it as their southernmost garrison. The open ground between the settlements has become a relentless killing ground, where Alliance and Horde champions skirmish for control of Hillsbrad.","Hillsbrad's violence reaches back to the Second War, when its coast and hills saw the first massive clashes between the Grand Alliance and the Old Horde. Durnholde Keep later served as the internment camp where Thrall was raised before leading the orcish rebellion. Now the keep lies in ruins, held by the Syndicate, displaced human nobles turned bandits. Coastal murlocs, hostile gnolls, and the shadowed dead on Purgation Isle leave no corner of the hills secure."],"hash":"511206","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"f88e961595","sec":82},"female-narrator":{"sha":"7ba3f994fb","sec":90}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Hillsbrad Foothills (Classic)","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Hillsbrad_Foothills_(Classic)"},{"kind":"wiki","title":"Hillsbrad Foothills","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Hillsbrad_Foothills"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/subzone/southshore","n":"Southshore","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/tarren-mill","n":"Tarren Mill","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/durnholde-keep","n":"Durnholde Keep","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/hillsbrad-fields","n":"Hillsbrad Fields","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/dun-garok","n":"Dun Garok","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/purgation-isle","n":"Purgation Isle","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/zone/alterac","n":"Alterac Mountains","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/zone/arathi","n":"Arathi Highlands","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/npc/karos-razok","n":"Karos Razok","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/azurelode-mine","n":"Azurelode Mine","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/chillwind-point","n":"Chillwind Point","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/corrahn-s-dagger","n":"Corrahn's Dagger","k":"subzone"}],"children":[{"p":"/lore/subzone/azurelode-mine","n":"Azurelode Mine","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/chillwind-point","n":"Chillwind Point","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/corrahn-s-dagger","n":"Corrahn's Dagger","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/darrow-hill","n":"Darrow Hill","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/dun-garok","n":"Dun Garok","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/durnholde-keep","n":"Durnholde Keep","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/eastern-strand","n":"Eastern Strand","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/growless-cave","n":"Growless Cave","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/hillsbrad-fields","n":"Hillsbrad Fields","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/lordamere-lake","n":"Lordamere Lake","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/nethander-stead","n":"Nethander Stead","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/purgation-isle","n":"Purgation 